gured is invalid. Your own Postman test also returns 401 Unauthorized – invalid_api_key, which clearly indicates that the API key itself is not valid.\\n\\nPlease understand that if an external API key is invalid, expired, incorrectly copied, or improperly configured, the script cannot make that API work. This does not mean that the script has a bug.\\n\\nWe provide free technical support to help customers configure and use the product correctly, and our team has already responded to your ticket with the relevant evidence and guidance. We kindly ask you to check your support ticket and follow the provided instructions.\\n\\nBefore publicly claiming t", "product_name": "WaGenius", "feedback_type": "complaint", "is_suggestive": false, "detected_issue": "Software runtime errors, fatal server crashes, or unhandled exceptions.", "suggested_angle": "Demonstrate tested codebase reliability and zero fatal crash track record.", "relevant_feature": "Stable and strictly tested codebase with unit tests and bug-fix warranty"}, {"id": "comm_2_ddokg", "topic": "bugs_errors", "rating": null, "severity": "high", "sentiment": "negative", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "abunowmankalim53", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32084791", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "topic_label": "Bug / System Error", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.045Z", "comment_date": "5 days ago", "comment_text": "I setup chatgpt api correctly, but its not working.", "product_name": "WaGenius", "feedback_type": "complaint", "is_suggestive": false, "detected_issue": "Software runtime errors, fatal server crashes, or unhandled exceptions.", "suggested_angle": "Demonstrate tested codebase reliability and zero fatal crash track record.", "relevant_feature": "Stable and strictly tested codebase with unit tests and bug-fix warranty"}, {"id": "comm_3_whmbu", "topic": "bugs_errors", "rating": null, "severity": "high", "sentiment": "negative", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "wStacks", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32085108", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "topic_label": "Bug / System Error", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.045Z", "comment_date": "4 days ago", "comment_text": "Please double-check that your ChatGPT/OpenAI API key has been entered correctly. Also, make sure your OpenAI account has sufficient API credits/billing balance, as the API may not work without an active balance or billing setup.\\n\\nIf the issue still persists, please open a support ticket and provide the error details or screenshots so our technical team can investigate the issue properly.\\n\\nPlease also note our support hours, as mentioned on the product description page.\\n\\nThank you.", "product_name": "WaGenius", "feedback_type": "complaint", "is_suggestive": false, "detected_issue": "Software runtime errors, fatal server crashes, or unhandled exceptions.", "suggested_angle": "Demonstrate tested codebase reliability and zero fatal crash track record.", "relevant_feature": "Stable and strictly tested codebase with unit tests and bug-fix warranty"}, {"id": "comm_4_hn69e", "topic": "general_question", "rating": null, "severity": "low", "sentiment": "neutral", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "khoiron", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32065883", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "topic_label": "General Suggestion / Inquiry", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.046Z", "comment_date": "about 1 month ago", "comment_text": "I can’t submit ticket, please assist. Product selection is not available", "product_name": "WaGenius", "feedback_type": "suggestion", "is_suggestive": true, "detected_issue": "User submitted a constructive suggestion, pre-sales inquiry, or feature query.", "suggested_angle": "Highlight product flexibility and clear pre-sales guidance.", "relevant_feature": "Comprehensive software solution with modular architecture"}, {"id": "comm_5_hvhsz", "topic": "feature_suggestion", "rating": null, "severity": "low", "sentiment": "neutral", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "wStacks", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32066159", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "topic_label": "Feature Suggestion", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.046Z", "comment_date": "about 1 month ago", "comment_text": "First, please add the product to your account using your purchase code.\\n\\nAfter adding the product successfully, you’ll be able to create a support ticket and select the product from the list.", "product_name": "WaGenius", "feedback_type": "feature_request", "is_suggestive": true, "detected_issue": "User suggested a new feature or functionality to expand system capabilities.", "suggested_angle": "Showcase that our product natively includes this sought-after feature or workflow.", "relevant_feature": "Modular extensible plugin architecture with rich native feature set"}, {"id": "comm_7_sdm1v", "topic": "general_question", "rating": null, "severity": "low", "sentiment": "neutral", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "wStacks", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32067834", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "topic_label": "General Suggestion / Inquiry", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.046Z", "comment_date": "about 1 month ago", "comment_text": "Hope you’ve already received a response from our support team.\\n\\nIf you have any further questions or need any additional assistance, please feel free to let us know. We’re always happy to help.", "product_name": "WaGenius", "feedback_type": "suggestion", "is_suggestive": true, "detected_issue": "User submitted a constructive suggestion, pre-sales inquiry, or feature query.", "suggested_angle": "Highlight product flexibility and clear pre-sales guidance.", "relevant_feature": "Comprehensive software solution with modular architecture"}, {"id": "comm_8_8pzhg", "topic": "installation_problems", "rating": null, "severity": "high", "sentiment": "negative", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "i3bdsami", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32063617", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "topic_label": "Installation & Setup", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.046Z", "comment_date": "about 1 month ago", "comment_text": "Does it include free installation? And does it have RTL language", "product_name": "WaGenius", "feedback_type": "complaint", "is_suggestive": false, "detected_issue": "Hurdles with initial server setup, missing extension requirements, or broken installation script.", "suggested_angle": "Emphasize automated 5-minute setup wizard and pre-configured environment templates.", "relevant_feature": "Turnkey 1-Click Installation Script & Docker deployment container"}, {"id": "comm_9_3xgzd", "topic": "installation_problems", "rating": null, "severity": "high", "sentiment": "negative", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "wStacks", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32066164", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "topic_label": "Installation & Setup", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.046Z", "comment_date": "about 1 month ago", "comment_text": "Thank you for your interest in WaGenius.\\n\\nYes, we provide free installation on a cPanel-powered server (one installation per license).\\n\\nCurrently, RTL language support is not available. However, we’ve noted it as a requested feature and will try to include RTL support in a future update based on customer demand.\\n\\nIf you have any other questions, feel free to ask. We’d be happy to help!", "product_name": "WaGenius", "feedback_type": "complaint", "is_suggestive": false, "detected_issue": "Hurdles with initial server setup, missing extension requirements, or broken installation script.", "suggested_angle": "Emphasize automated 5-minute setup wizard and pre-configured environment templates.", "relevant_feature": "Turnkey 1-Click Installation Script & Docker deployment container"}, {"id": "comm_10_2hgnl", "topic": "feature_suggestion", "rating": null, "severity": "low", "sentiment": "neutral", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "yeisonorozcog", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32061530", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "topic_label": "Feature Suggestion", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.046Z", "comment_date": "about 1 month ago", "comment_text": "A good suggestion for AI settings is to allow saving AI settings by selecting one of the associated WhatsApp accounts, since currently the settings are global and don’t take specific configurations for each account.\\n\\nThe idea is to be able to choose a WhatsApp account if there are multiple accounts, similar to how you choose when creating a new flow builder or when creating templates.\\n\\nWhatsApp settings should be independent for each WhatsApp account, not global.\\n\\nYou could look into e-commerce stores in the same way.", "product_name": "WaGenius", "feedback_type": "feature_request", "is_suggestive": true, "detected_issue": "User suggested a new feature or functionality to expand system capabilities.", "suggested_angle": "Showcase that our product natively includes this sought-after feature or workflow.", "relevant_feature": "Modular extensible plugin architecture with rich native feature set"}, {"id": "comm_11_05f4b", "topic": "feature_suggestion", "rating": null, "severity": "low", "sentiment": "neutral", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "wStacks", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32062567", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "topic_label": "Feature Suggestion", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.046Z", "comment_date": "about 1 month ago", "comment_text": "Thank you very much for your valuable suggestion.\\n\\nWe really appreciate your feedback. It’s a great idea, and we’ll definitely keep it in mind for a future update. Suggestions like yours help us improve the product and make it better for everyone.\\n\\nThanks again for taking the time to share your thoughts!", "product_name": "WaGenius", "feedback_type": "feature_request", "is_suggestive": true, "detected_issue": "User suggested a new feature or functionality to expand system capabilities.", "suggested_angle": "Showcase that our product natively includes this sought-after feature or workflow.", "relevant_feature": "Modular extensible plugin architecture with rich native feature set"}, {"id": "comm_12_h7lok", "topic": "pricing_dissatisfaction", "rating": null, "severity": "high", "sentiment": "negative", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "saurabhsss", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32059372", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "topic_label": "Pricing & Licensing", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.046Z", "comment_date": "about 2 months ago", "comment_text": "We want to become a BSP. Do you have a credit/wallet system where we can assign credits to each tenant, and Meta usage charges are deducted from our master balance? In other words, can we provide prepaid or postpaid credit to tenants while Meta bills us as the BSP? How is this managed in your platform?\\n\\nYou can also add:\\n\\nDoes the platform support a master wallet for the BSP?\\nCan we allocate credits to individual tenants?\\nAre WhatsApp conversation charges automatically deducted from the tenant’s wallet?\\nCan we set prepaid and postpaid billing models?\\nCan the system automatically suspend messaging when a tenant’s credit reaches zero?\\nDoes it generate tenant-wise invoices and usage reports?\\n\\nThese questions will help confirm whether the platform is suitable for operating as a WhatsApp BSP/reseller.", "product_name": "WaGenius", "feedback_type": "complaint", "is_suggestive": false, "detected_issue": "Payment processing errors, billing disputes, or unhonored refund requests.", "suggested_angle": "Showcase transparent one-time purchase terms with no hidden renewal charges.", "relevant_feature": "Transparent licensing terms with verified refund policy and clear pricing"}, {"id": "comm_13_kkjpn", "topic": "integration_request", "rating": null, "severity": "medium", "sentiment": "neutral", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "wStacks", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32060765", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "topic_label": "Integration Request", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.046Z", "comment_date": "about 1 month ago", "comment_text": "I appreciate your interest in WaGenius.\\n\\nThe current version of WaGenius is designed as a WhatsApp CRM and automation platform, and it does not include a BSP (Business Solution Provider) billing system by default.\\n\\nTherefore, the features are not available in the current version:\\n\\nIf you’re planning to operate as a WhatsApp BSP/reseller, these features can be developed as a customisation based on your specific business requirements.\\n\\nIf you’d like, please get in touch with us via our support portal or WhatsApp with your detailed requirements, and we’ll review them and provide a customisation proposal with the estimated budget and timeline.\\n\\nWhatsApp: +8801738298601\\n\\nSupport Portal: https://wstacks.com/public/auth/login\\n\\nThank you!", "product_name": "WaGenius", "feedback_type": "suggestion", "is_suggestive": true, "detected_issue": "Customer requested integration with external payment gateways, SMS services, or third-party APIs.", "suggested_angle": "Demonstrate verified built-in payment gateway integrations and API webhooks.", "relevant_feature": "Pre-built multi-gateway integrations and extensible webhook architecture"}, {"id": "comm_14_ievvu", "topic": "slow_performance", "rating": null, "severity": "medium", "sentiment": "negative", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "smmnew", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32056228", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "topic_label": "Performance & Speed", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.046Z", "comment_date": "about 2 months ago", "comment_text": "Support ticket reply very very slow for 1 reply after 14- 16 hours then next question reply 14-15 hrs one prob solve 5-7 days its tooo slow suppoert team plz improve it", "product_name": "WaGenius", "feedback_type": "complaint", "is_suggestive": false, "detected_issue": "Sluggish page load speeds, memory leaks, or unoptimized database queries.", "suggested_angle": "Demonstrate lightweight benchmarked speed and optimized asset delivery.", "relevant_feature": "High-performance optimized architecture with Redis caching and query indexing"}, {"id": "comm_15_bdxl2", "topic": "installation_problems", "rating": null, "severity": "high", "sentiment": "negative", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "wStacks", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32056445", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "topic_label": "Installation & Setup", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.046Z", "comment_date": "about 2 months ago", "comment_text": "Thank you for your feedback, and we sincerely apologize for the delay.\\n\\nThe previous day was our weekend, which affected our response time. We respond to support tickets in the order they are received to ensure fair support for all customers.\\n\\nFor Meta Cloud API configuration, we have also provided detailed documentation, which helps resolve many common setup issues.\\n\\nThat said, we understand your concern and are continuously working to improve our support response times. We appreciate your patience and understanding.\\n\\nThank you for your valuable feedback.", "product_name": "WaGenius", "feedback_type": "complaint", "is_suggestive": false, "detected_issue": "Hurdles with initial server setup, missing extension requirements, or broken installation script.", "suggested_angle": "Emphasize automated 5-minute setup wizard and pre-configured environment templates.", "relevant_feature": "Turnkey 1-Click Installation Script & Docker deployment container"}, {"id": "comm_16_xp5qc", "topic": "feature_suggestion", "rating": null, "severity": "low", "sentiment": "neutral", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "OneiooTech", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32054590", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "topic_label": "Feature Suggestion", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.046Z", "comment_date": "about 2 months ago", "comment_text": "Any Plan For Flutter APP ?", "product_name": "WaGenius", "feedback_type": "feature_request", "is_suggestive": true, "detected_issue": "User suggested a new feature or functionality to expand system capabilities.", "suggested_angle": "Showcase that our product natively includes this sought-after feature or workflow.", "relevant_feature": "Modular extensible plugin architecture with rich native feature set"}, {"id": "comm_17_gs4q1", "topic": "general_question", "rating": null, "severity": "low", "sentiment": "neutral", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "wStacks", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32055018", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "topic_label": "General Suggestion / Inquiry", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.046Z", "comment_date": "about 2 months ago", "comment_text": "Thank you for your interest.\\n\\nYes, we have plans to develop a Flutter mobile app in the future. Its development will primarily depend on customer demand. As more users request it, we’ll prioritize adding an official Flutter app to the WaGenius ecosystem.", "product_name": "WaGenius", "feedback_type": "suggestion", "is_suggestive": true, "detected_issue": "User submitted a constructive suggestion, pre-sales inquiry, or feature query.", "suggested_angle": "Highlight product flexibility and clear pre-sales guidance.", "relevant_feature": "Comprehensive software solution with modular architecture"}, {"id": "comm_18_9plk6", "topic": "installation_problems", "rating": null, "severity": "high", "sentiment": "negative", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "Haridasa", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32049736", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "topic_label": "Installation & Setup", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.046Z", "comment_date": "2 months ago", "comment_text": "Pre sales question. are you do complete installation in our server with whasapp API. end to end support on additional fees", "product_name": "WaGenius", "feedback_type": "complaint", "is_suggestive": false, "detected_issue": "Hurdles with initial server setup, missing extension requirements, or broken installation script.", "suggested_angle": "Emphasize automated 5-minute setup wizard and pre-configured environment templates.", "relevant_feature": "Turnkey 1-Click Installation Script & Docker deployment container"}, {"id": "comm_19_jzht9", "topic": "installation_problems", "rating": null, "severity": "high", "sentiment": "negative", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "wStacks", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32049835", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "topic_label": "Installation & Setup", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.046Z", "comment_date": "2 months ago", "comment_text": "Thank you for your interest in our product.\\n\\nRegarding the installation, we provide one-time free installation on a cPanel-powered server for each valid license.\\n\\nFor the WhatsApp API, Meta account, and other third-party service configurations, these need to be completed on your side. We have provided detailed documentation for the Meta account configuration, and if you encounter any difficulties, our technical support team will be happy to guide and assist you throughout the process.\\n\\nIf you prefer our team to handle the complete WhatsApp API, Meta account, and other required configurations on your behalf, we can certainly do that as a paid technical support service.\\n\\nYou can also contact us directly on our official WhatsApp: +880 1738-298601\\n\\nAnd our support portal: https://wstacks.com/public/auth/login\\n\\nIf you need any further information or assistance, please don’t hesitate to reach out. We’re always happy to help.", "product_name": "WaGenius", "feedback_type": "complaint", "is_suggestive": false, "detected_issue": "Hurdles with initial server setup, missing extension requirements, or broken installation script.", "suggested_angle": "Emphasize automated 5-minute setup wizard and pre-configured environment templates.", "relevant_feature": "Turnkey 1-Click Installation Script & Docker deployment container"}, {"id": "comm_20_6n08q", "topic": "poor_documentation", "rating": null, "severity": "medium", "sentiment": "negative", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "khushjoshi", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32041447", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "topic_label": "Documentation & Guides", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.046Z", "comment_date": "2 months ago", "comment_text": "can i register as BSP and meta approve it ?? please give proper document or video for process and guide thanks", "product_name": "WaGenius", "feedback_type": "complaint", "is_suggestive": false, "detected_issue": "Missing, outdated, or confusing setup manuals and API references.", "suggested_angle": "Highlight searchable interactive documentation with code examples and diagrams.", "relevant_feature": "Comprehensive step-by-step documentation with video guides and full API reference"}, {"id": "comm_21_8o34w", "topic": "poor_documentation", "rating": null, "severity": "medium", "sentiment": "negative", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "wStacks", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32042151", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "topic_label": "Documentation & Guides", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.046Z", "comment_date": "2 months ago", "comment_text": "Yes, you can apply to become a Meta Business Solution Provider (BSP). However, the approval is entirely at Meta’s discretion and depends on whether your company meets their eligibility requirements.\\n\\nMeta evaluates factors such as your business verification, company profile, website, technical capabilities, customer support, compliance with WhatsApp and Meta policies, and your ability to serve businesses at scale.\\n\\nUnfortunately, we do not provide documentation or guidance for the BSP application process, as it is managed directly by Meta. We recommend referring to Meta’s official Business Partner documentation and application resources for the latest requirements and procedures.", "product_name": "WaGenius", "feedback_type": "complaint", "is_suggestive": false, "detected_issue": "Missing, outdated, or confusing setup manuals and API references.", "suggested_angle": "Highlight searchable interactive documentation with code examples and diagrams.", "relevant_feature": "Comprehensive step-by-step documentation with video guides and full API reference"}, {"id": "comm_22_mavqi", "topic": "general_question", "rating": null, "severity": "low", "sentiment": "neutral", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "yeisonorozcog", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32037061", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "topic_label": "General Suggestion / Inquiry", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.046Z", "comment_date": "3 months ago", "comment_text": "Why is the keyword matching feature limited to a single word, and not when it’s part of a phrase?\\n\\nFor example: The bot responds to the word “Information.”\\n\\nThe bot doesn’t respond to the phrase “I want more information.”\\n\\nThe AI ​​response also doesn’t work automatically. Is it always necessary to go to Live Chat and select the “Reply with AI” icon? This doesn’t make sense.", "product_name": "WaGenius", "feedback_type": "suggestion", "is_suggestive": true, "detected_issue": "User submitted a constructive suggestion, pre-sales inquiry, or feature query.", "suggested_angle": "Highlight product flexibility and clear pre-sales guidance.", "relevant_feature": "Comprehensive software solution with modular architecture"}, {"id": "comm_23_65yty", "topic": "poor_documentation", "rating": null, "severity": "medium", "sentiment": "negative", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "wStacks", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32037377", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "topic_label": "Documentation & Guides", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.046Z", "comment_date": "3 months ago", "comment_text": "Thank you for your question.\\n\\nThe keyword matching system is designed to work with specific keywords or exact phrases that you define in the Flow Builder. For example, if you add the keyword “information”, the bot will respond when that keyword is detected according to the configured matching rules.\\n\\nYou can add multiple keywords and configure the chat reply exactly as you want. For example, you may add keywords such as “information”, “details”, “pricing”, and “help”, all pointing to the same automated response.\\n\\nIf you need more advanced matching logic, such as detecting keywords within longer sentences, partial matches, or natural language intent recognition, this can be implemented through custom development based on your requirements.\\n\\nRegarding AI replies, the current implementation is designed to require manual confirmation by clicking the “Reply with AI” button. This approach was chosen because many customers prefer to review, edit, or approve AI-generated responses before sendi", "product_name": "WaGenius", "feedback_type": "complaint", "is_suggestive": false, "detected_issue": "Missing, outdated, or confusing setup manuals and API references.", "suggested_angle": "Highlight searchable interactive documentation with code examples and diagrams.", "relevant_feature": "Comprehensive step-by-step documentation with video guides and full API reference"}, {"id": "comm_24_dka1p", "topic": "integration_request", "rating": null, "severity": "medium", "sentiment": "neutral", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "imranashraf3", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32032967", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "topic_label": "Integration Request", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.046Z", "comment_date": "3 months ago", "comment_text": "Does it support an unofficial QR-based login, or is a Meta API key required? If QR-based login is available, what are the differences between the two methods in terms of features? Do both support all features? Is a REST API key available for connecting a QR-based WhatsApp device with external applications?", "product_name": "WaGenius", "feedback_type": "suggestion", "is_suggestive": true, "detected_issue": "Customer requested integration with external payment gateways, SMS services, or third-party APIs.", "suggested_angle": "Demonstrate verified built-in payment gateway integrations and API webhooks.", "relevant_feature": "Pre-built multi-gateway integrations and extensible webhook architecture"}, {"id": "comm_25_1jsse", "topic": "integration_request", "rating": null, "severity": "medium", "sentiment": "neutral", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "wStacks", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32033904", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "topic_label": "Integration Request", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.046Z", "comment_date": "3 months ago", "comment_text": "Yes, WaGenius supports both connection methods:\\n\\n1. QR-Based WhatsApp Login\\n\\nUsers can connect their WhatsApp accounts by scanning a QR code. No Meta API key or Meta Business verification is required. The QR connection is powered through our integrated third-party WhatsApp connection provider.\\n\\n2. Meta WhatsApp Cloud API\\n\\nUsers can connect through the official Meta Cloud API. We provide a built-in system to create and connect Meta Cloud API accounts directly from the platform.\\n\\nExternal API Access:\\n\\nExternal REST API integration is available only for Meta Cloud API-connected accounts.\\n\\nQR-based WhatsApp connections work fully inside the WaGenius platform, but they do not expose external API endpoints for third-party applications. If you need to connect WhatsApp with external systems such as ERP, CRM, custom applications, or other third-party software through an API, we recommend using the Meta Cloud API connection.", "product_name": "WaGenius", "feedback_type": "suggestion", "is_suggestive": true, "detected_issue": "Customer requested integration with external payment gateways, SMS services, or third-party APIs.", "suggested_angle": "Demonstrate verified built-in payment gateway integrations and API webhooks.", "relevant_feature": "Pre-built multi-gateway integrations and extensible webhook architecture"}, {"id": "comm_26_r053x", "topic": "general_question", "rating": null, "severity": "low", "sentiment": "neutral", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "khushjoshi", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32030786", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "topic_label": "General Suggestion / Inquiry", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.046Z", "comment_date": "3 months ago", "comment_text": "Can i create self BSP details and enable ?/ then use embedded signup ?? or any other rule required?\\n\\nplease now give Instagram chat inbox and automation system", "product_name": "WaGenius", "feedback_type": "suggestion", "is_suggestive": true, "detected_issue": "User submitted a constructive suggestion, pre-sales inquiry, or feature query.", "suggested_angle": "Highlight product flexibility and clear pre-sales guidance.", "relevant_feature": "Comprehensive software solution with modular architecture"}, {"id": "comm_27_xcr9t", "topic": "installation_problems", "rating": null, "severity": "high", "sentiment": "negative", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "wStacks", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32031881", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "topic_label": "Installation & Setup", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.046Z", "comment_date": "3 months ago", "comment_text": "Yes, you can use your own BSP details and enable WhatsApp Embedded Signup. However, you must first complete the required Meta Business setup and verification process, and configure the necessary WhatsApp App credentials correctly.\\n\\nPlease note that Meta controls the approval and verification requirements, while WaGenius provides the Embedded Signup integration and management system.\\n\\nFor technical assistance with the setup, please open a support ticket at: https://wstacks.com/public/auth/login", "product_name": "WaGenius", "feedback_type": "complaint", "is_suggestive": false, "detected_issue": "Hurdles with initial server setup, missing extension requirements, or broken installation script.", "suggested_angle": "Emphasize automated 5-minute setup wizard and pre-configured environment templates.", "relevant_feature": "Turnkey 1-Click Installation Script & Docker deployment container"}, {"id": "comm_28_2yiwj", "topic": "general_question", "rating": null, "severity": "low", "sentiment": "neutral", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "adalinho05", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32025827", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "topic_label": "General Suggestion / Inquiry", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.046Z", "comment_date": "3 months ago", "comment_text": "Hi. The idea would be to market it to my clients. And these clients have several employees who will be the users of the system. Can they transfer conversations between registered users? Can more than one user be registered per client?\\n\\nAnother question. I haven’t seen anything close to a sales funnel, with Kanban.", "product_name": "WaGenius", "feedback_type": "suggestion", "is_suggestive": true, "detected_issue": "User submitted a constructive suggestion, pre-sales inquiry, or feature query.", "suggested_angle": "Highlight product flexibility and clear pre-sales guidance.", "relevant_feature": "Comprehensive software solution with modular architecture"}, {"id": "comm_29_dpusl", "topic": "general_question", "rating": null, "severity": "low", "sentiment": "neutral", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "wStacks", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32026387", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "topic_label": "General Suggestion / Inquiry", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.046Z", "comment_date": "3 months ago", "comment_text": "Yes, clients can register multiple agents/users under their account. Each registered agent can use the system based on the permissions assigned by the main client/admin. For example, the client can control which features the agent can access, such as inbox conversations, contacts, campaigns, automation, or other modules. Conversation transfer/assignment between agents can also be managed based on the system’s agent/team permission structure.\\n\\nRegarding the sales funnel/Kanban feature, it is not available as a default core feature right now.\\n\\nIf you need a sales funnel or Kanban-style CRM pipeline, it can be added through customization based on your required workflow.\\n\\nPlease open a customization ticket: https://wstacks.com/public/auth/login", "product_name": "WaGenius", "feedback_type": "suggestion", "is_suggestive": true, "detected_issue": "User submitted a constructive suggestion, pre-sales inquiry, or feature query.", "suggested_angle": "Highlight product flexibility and clear pre-sales guidance.", "relevant_feature": "Comprehensive software solution with modular architecture"}, {"id": "comm_30_7tnij", "topic": "general_question", "rating": null, "severity": "low", "sentiment": "neutral", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "kanishkaceo", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32024564", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "topic_label": "General Suggestion / Inquiry", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.046Z", "comment_date": "3 months ago", "comment_text": "can we connetc with offical meta whastapp api with meta an dalso is there opytion at whast cost we provide message to use like per meesga ecost", "product_name": "WaGenius", "feedback_type": "suggestion", "is_suggestive": true, "detected_issue": "User submitted a constructive suggestion, pre-sales inquiry, or feature query.", "suggested_angle": "Highlight product flexibility and clear pre-sales guidance.", "relevant_feature": "Comprehensive software solution with modular architecture"}, {"id": "comm_31_f98sw", "topic": "pricing_dissatisfaction", "rating": null, "severity": "high", "sentiment": "negative", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "wStacks", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32026388", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "topic_label": "Pricing & Licensing", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.046Z", "comment_date": "3 months ago", "comment_text": "Yes, you can connect the system with the official Meta WhatsApp Cloud API.\\n\\nHowever, right now there is no built-in option in the system to manage or charge message cost per message. The message cost will depend on Meta’s official WhatsApp pricing, and billing will be handled directly from Meta’s side.\\n\\nIf you need a custom per-message cost or credit-based billing system for your clients, that can be added through customization.\\n\\nPlease open a customization ticket: https://wstacks.com/public/auth/login", "product_name": "WaGenius", "feedback_type": "complaint", "is_suggestive": false, "detected_issue": "Payment processing errors, billing disputes, or unhonored refund requests.", "suggested_angle": "Showcase transparent one-time purchase terms with no hidden renewal charges.", "relevant_feature": "Transparent licensing terms with verified refund policy and clear pricing"}, {"id": "comm_32_sgvl0", "topic": "bugs_errors", "rating": null, "severity": "high", "sentiment": "negative", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "khushjoshi", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32024499", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "topic_label": "Bug / System Error", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.046Z", "comment_date": "3 months ago", "comment_text": "i have crate campaign but not working for send have issue", "product_name": "WaGenius", "feedback_type": "complaint", "is_suggestive": false, "detected_issue": "Software runtime errors, fatal server crashes, or unhandled exceptions.", "suggested_angle": "Demon