egrations and API webhooks.", "relevant_feature": "Pre-built multi-gateway integrations and extensible webhook architecture"}, {"id": "comm_27_n8bu5", "topic": "integration_request", "rating": null, "severity": "medium", "sentiment": "neutral", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "Hesham_Adel", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32073687", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/whatscrm-whatsapp-crm-ai-automation-and-multichannel-saas-bundle-nodejs-script/63933531", "topic_label": "Integration Request", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.047Z", "comment_date": "24 days ago", "comment_text": "Hello, I’m considering WhatsCRM as the core of a commercial SaaS platform. I plan to rebrand it and offer it to multiple clients through monthly/annual subscriptions.\\n\\nBefore purchasing, please confirm:\\n\\n1. Does the license allow commercial SaaS/reselling to multiple paying clients?\\n\\n2. Is full white-labeling allowed (brand, logo, domain, colors, etc.)?\\n\\n3. Is it fully multi-tenant with complete data/account isolation between clients?\\n\\n4. Does the purchase include the complete editable React source code (.tsx), not only compiled files?\\n\\n5. Facebook/Instagram comments: Does it support comment → public reply and/or comment → DM, including keyword triggers?\\n\\n6. If not, can comment automation be added through an official add-on, API or Webhooks?\\n\\n7. Are APIs/Webhooks available for WhatsApp, Facebook, Instagram, contacts, conversations and automation, for integration with n8n?\\n\\n8. Can each SaaS client connect their own WhatsApp, Facebook Page and Instagram account independently?\\n\\nThese poin", "product_name": "WhatsCRM | WhatsApp CRM, AI Automation and Multi", "feedback_type": "suggestion", "is_suggestive": true, "detected_issue": "Customer requested integration with external payment gateways, SMS services, or third-party APIs.", "suggested_angle": "Demonstrate verified built-in payment gateway integrations and API webhooks.", "relevant_feature": "Pre-built multi-gateway integrations and extensible webhook architecture"}, {"id": "comm_28_y49x7", "topic": "general_question", "rating": null, "severity": "low", "sentiment": "neutral", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "softwebian", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32073456", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/whatscrm-whatsapp-crm-ai-automation-and-multichannel-saas-bundle-nodejs-script/63933531", "topic_label": "General Suggestion / Inquiry", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.047Z", "comment_date": "24 days ago", "comment_text": "i am not getting support please help asap waiting from 3 days for proper solution message no sending", "product_name": "WhatsCRM | WhatsApp CRM, AI Automation and Multi", "feedback_type": "suggestion", "is_suggestive": true, "detected_issue": "User submitted a constructive suggestion, pre-sales inquiry, or feature query.", "suggested_angle": "Highlight product flexibility and clear pre-sales guidance.", "relevant_feature": "Comprehensive software solution with modular architecture"}, {"id": "comm_29_46i9g", "topic": "integration_request", "rating": null, "severity": "medium", "sentiment": "neutral", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "codeyon_itservices", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32073880", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/whatscrm-whatsapp-crm-ai-automation-and-multichannel-saas-bundle-nodejs-script/63933531", "topic_label": "Integration Request", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.047Z", "comment_date": "23 days ago", "comment_text": "Hello softwebian, You are already receiving support, and your issue is being handled through the support channel.\\n\\nPlease note that support responses can sometimes take a few hours depending on the issue and the information required to investigate it. However, saying that you have been left without support for 3 days is not accurate, as we have been in communication regarding your issue.\\n\\nWe understand your frustration and are working to resolve the message-sending issue as soon as possible.\\n\\nThanks", "product_name": "WhatsCRM | WhatsApp CRM, AI Automation and Multi", "feedback_type": "suggestion", "is_suggestive": true, "detected_issue": "Customer requested integration with external payment gateways, SMS services, or third-party APIs.", "suggested_angle": "Demonstrate verified built-in payment gateway integrations and API webhooks.", "relevant_feature": "Pre-built multi-gateway integrations and extensible webhook architecture"}, {"id": "comm_30_0v6gk", "topic": "general_question", "rating": null, "severity": "low", "sentiment": "neutral", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "CodexLaza_", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32072933", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/whatscrm-whatsapp-crm-ai-automation-and-multichannel-saas-bundle-nodejs-script/63933531", "topic_label": "General Suggestion / Inquiry", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.047Z", "comment_date": "25 days ago", "comment_text": "I get all other premium add-ons too in the future which you release in this bundle.", "product_name": "WhatsCRM | WhatsApp CRM, AI Automation and Multi", "feedback_type": "suggestion", "is_suggestive": true, "detected_issue": "User submitted a constructive suggestion, pre-sales inquiry, or feature query.", "suggested_angle": "Highlight product flexibility and clear pre-sales guidance.", "relevant_feature": "Comprehensive software solution with modular architecture"}, {"id": "comm_31_uyc8m", "topic": "general_question", "rating": null, "severity": "low", "sentiment": "neutral", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "codeyon_itservices", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32075573", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/whatscrm-whatsapp-crm-ai-automation-and-multichannel-saas-bundle-nodejs-script/63933531", "topic_label": "General Suggestion / Inquiry", "collected_at": "2026-09-07T14:45:39.048Z", "comment_date": "20 days ago