ions or need any additional", "A good suggestion for AI settings is to allow saving AI settings by selecting one of the associated WhatsApp accounts, s", "Thank you very much for your valuable suggestion.\\n\\nWe really appreciate your feedback. It’s a great idea, and we’ll defi", "I appreciate your interest in WaGenius.\\n\\nThe current version of WaGenius is designed as a WhatsApp CRM and automation pl"], "comments_unavailable": false, "recent_negative_count": 21}, {"product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/whatscrm-whatsapp-crm-ai-automation-and-multichannel-saas-bundle-nodejs-script/63933531", "suggestions": [{"count": 2, "topic": "Workflow & Customization Suggestion", "sample": "First of all, congratulations on your work. I am interested in purchasing the platform, but I would like to clarify a few points regarding customization:\\n\\nIs it"}, {"count": 13, "topic": "General Suggestion / Inquiry", "sample": "Hello aman88work, Thank you for showing your interest. The answer will remain the same, as everything is already mentioned in the description. Please read the d"}, {"count": 7, "topic": "Integration Request", "sample": "Hello, I’m evaluating WhatsCRM as the core of a multi-tenant SaaS under my own brand (Extended License). Four specific questions before purchase, I’d appreciate"}], "product_name": "WhatsCRM | WhatsApp CRM, AI Automation and Multi", "neutral_count": 0, "negative_count": 13, "positive_count": 0, "total_comments": 35, "sentiment_trend": "Heavy Complaints", "suggestive_count": 22, "common_complaints": [{"count": 9, "topic": "Installation & Setup", "sample": "I am interested in purchasing your product, but before proceeding, I’d like to confirm a few technical details regarding customization.\\n\\nOur dev team the descri"}, {"count": 2, "topic": "Documentation & Guides", "sample": "Hello Author,\\n\\nPlease let me as under:\\n\\n1. Can a completely independent customer create/connect their own Meta Business Portfolio, WABA and WhatsApp Business ph"}], "requested_features": ["First of all, congratulations on your work. I am interested in purchasing the platform, but I would like to clarify a fe", "Hello aman88work, Thank you for showing your interest. The answer will remain the same, as everything is already mention", "Hello, I’m evaluating WhatsCRM as the core of a multi-tenant SaaS under my own brand (Extended License). Four specific q", "Hello mehboobafridi, If you set up Embedded Login as an admin, other people (users) can use your Embedded Login to log i", "Does the bundle also include the mobile app?", "Hi, I have purchased this script; contacted on Whatsapp support but no response Where I can go to submit ticket"], "comments_unavailable": false, "recent_negative_count": 13}], "total_analyzed": 78, "unresolved_count": 12, "recurring_complaints": [{"id": "rcg_63012794_bugsystemerror", "severity": "high", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32086383", "is_critical": false, "feedback_type": "complaint", "is_suggestive": false, "mention_count": 6, "short_summary": "Software runtime errors, fatal server crashes, or unhandled exceptions.", "competitor_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "competitor_name": "WaGenius", "confidence_level": "High", "complaint_category": "Bug / System Error", "latest_occurrence_date": "4 days ago", "representative_comment": "We strongly disagree with the statement that WaGenius is full of bugs. The issue reported here is not a bug in the script; it is an incorrect/invalid API configuration on your side.\\n\\nhttps://prnt.sc/KQQy2_qutnax\\n\\nAs already explained in your support ticket, we checked your configuration and provided screenshots showing that the OpenAI API key you configured is invalid. Your own Postman test also returns 401 Unauthorized – invalid_api_key, which clearly indicates that the API key itself is not valid.\\n\\nPlease understand that if an external API key is invalid, expired, incorrectly copied, or improperly configured, the script cannot make that API work. This does not mean that the script has a bug.\\n\\nWe provide free technical support to help customers configure and use the product correctly, and our team has already responded to your ticket with the relevant evidence and guidance. We kindly ask you to check your support ticket and follow the provided instructions.\\n\\nBefore publicly claiming t"}, {"id": "rcg_63012794_generalsuggestioninquiry", "severity": "low", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32026387", "is_critical": false, "feedback_type": "suggestion", "is_suggestive": true, "mention_count": 13, "short_summary": "User submitted a constructive suggestion, pre-sales inquiry, or feature query.", "competitor_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "competitor_name": "WaGenius", "confidence_level": "High", "complaint_category": "General Suggestion / Inquiry", "latest_occurrence_date": "about 1 month ago", "representative_comment": "Yes, clients can register multiple agents/users under their account. Each registered agent can use the system based on the permissions assigned by the main client/admin. For example, the client can control which features the agent can access, such as inbox conversations, contacts, campaigns, automation, or other modules. Conversation transfer/assignment between agents can also be managed based on the system’s agent/team permission structure.\\n\\nRegarding the sales funnel/Kanban feature, it is not available as a default core feature right now.\\n\\nIf you need a sales funnel or Kanban-style CRM pipeline, it can be added through customization based on your required workflow.\\n\\nPlease open a customization ticket: https://wstacks.com/public/auth/login"}, {"id": "rcg_63012794_featuresuggestion", "severity": "low", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32061530", "is_critical": false, "feedback_type": "feature_request", "is_suggestive": true, "mention_count": 4, "short_summary": "User suggested a new feature or functionality to expand system capabilities.", "competitor_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "competitor_name": "WaGenius", "confidence_level": "High", "complaint_category": "Feature Suggestion", "latest_occurrence_date": "about 1 month ago", "representative_comment": "A good suggestion for AI settings is to allow saving AI settings by selecting one of the associated WhatsApp accounts, since currently the settings are global and don’t take specific configurations for each account.\\n\\nThe idea is to be able to choose a WhatsApp account if there are multiple accounts, similar to how you choose when creating a new flow builder or when creating templates.\\n\\nWhatsApp settings should be independent for each WhatsApp account, not global.\\n\\nYou could look into e-commerce stores in the same way."}, {"id": "rcg_63012794_installationsetup", "severity": "high", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32020127", "is_critical": false, "feedback_type": "complaint", "is_suggestive": false, "mention_count": 8, "short_summary": "Hurdles with initial server setup, missing extension requirements, or broken installation script.", "competitor_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "competitor_name": "WaGenius", "confidence_level": "High", "complaint_category": "Installation & Setup", "latest_occurrence_date": "about 1 month ago", "representative_comment": "Hi\\n\\nWe are evaluating WAPI for a large-scale deployment and would appreciate clarification on the following points:\\n\\n1. Source Code Ownership\\n\\nIs the source code provided fully unencrypted and un-obfuscated? Will we have complete developer access for customization and integration? 2. Credit System\\n\\nDoes WAPI include a built-in credit/usage management system? Can credits be assigned, deducted, and managed on a per-user basis? Is there support for reseller or sub-account level credit allocation? 3. Scalability\\n\\nCan the platform reliably handle approximately 5 million messages per month? Have you deployed WAPI at similar volumes in production? What server specifications do you recommend for this scale? 4. Multi-User API Architecture\\n\\nWe want to integrate WAPI with our own mobile/web application. Can we create multiple users under a single WAPI installation? Does each user get their own API credentials and WhatsApp account configuration? Is there a REST API available for user creation, acc"}, {"id": "rcg_63012794_pricinglicensing", "severity": "medium", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32059372", "is_critical": false, "feedback_type": "complaint", "is_suggestive": false, "mention_count": 2, "short_summary": "Payment processing errors, billing disputes, or unhonored refund requests.", "competitor_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "competitor_name": "WaGenius", "confidence_level": "Medium", "complaint_category": "Pricing & Licensing", "latest_occurrence_date": "about 2 months ago", "representative_comment": "We want to become a BSP. Do you have a credit/wallet system where we can assign credits to each tenant, and Meta usage charges are deducted from our master balance? In other words, can we provide prepaid or postpaid credit to tenants while Meta bills us as the BSP? How is this managed in your platform?\\n\\nYou can also add:\\n\\nDoes the platform support a master wallet for the BSP?\\nCan we allocate credits to individual tenants?\\nAre WhatsApp conversation charges automatically deducted from the tenant’s wallet?\\nCan we set prepaid and postpaid billing models?\\nCan the system automatically suspend messaging when a tenant’s credit reaches zero?\\nDoes it generate tenant-wise invoices and usage reports?\\n\\nThese questions will help confirm whether the platform is suitable for operating as a WhatsApp BSP/reseller."}, {"id": "rcg_63012794_integrationrequest", "severity": "low", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32033904", "is_critical": false, "feedback_type": "suggestion", "is_suggestive": true, "mention_count": 3, "short_summary": "Customer requested integration with external payment gateways, SMS services, or third-party APIs.", "competitor_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "competitor_name": "WaGenius", "confidence_level": "High", "complaint_category": "Integration Request", "latest_occurrence_date": "about 1 month ago", "representative_comment": "Yes, WaGenius supports both connection methods:\\n\\n1. QR-Based WhatsApp Login\\n\\nUsers can connect their WhatsApp accounts by scanning a QR code. No Meta API key or Meta Business verification is required. The QR connection is powered through our integrated third-party WhatsApp connection provider.\\n\\n2. Meta WhatsApp Cloud API\\n\\nUsers can connect through the official Meta Cloud API. We provide a built-in system to create and connect Meta Cloud API accounts directly from the platform.\\n\\nExternal API Access:\\n\\nExternal REST API integration is available only for Meta Cloud API-connected accounts.\\n\\nQR-based WhatsApp connections work fully inside the WaGenius platform, but they do not expose external API endpoints for third-party applications. If you need to connect WhatsApp with external systems such as ERP, CRM, custom applications, or other third-party software through an API, we recommend using the Meta Cloud API connection."}, {"id": "rcg_63012794_documentationguides", "severity": "high", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32037377", "is_critical": false, "feedback_type": "complaint", "is_suggestive": false, "mention_count": 3, "short_summary": "Missing, outdated, or confusing setup manuals and API references.", "competitor_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/wagenius-ai-whatsapp-crm-automation-platform/63012794", "competitor_name": "WaGenius", "confidence_level": "High", "complaint_category": "Documentation & Guides", "latest_occurrence_date": "2 months ago", "representative_comment": "Thank you for your question.\\n\\nThe keyword matching system is designed to work with specific keywords or exact phrases that you define in the Flow Builder. For example, if you add the keyword “information”, the bot will respond when that keyword is detected according to the configured matching rules.\\n\\nYou can add multiple keywords and configure the chat reply exactly as you want. For example, you may add keywords such as “information”, “details”, “pricing”, and “help”, all pointing to the same automated response.\\n\\nIf you need more advanced matching logic, such as detecting keywords within longer sentences, partial matches, or natural language intent recognition, this can be implemented through custom development based on your requirements.\\n\\nRegarding AI replies, the current implementation is designed to require manual confirmation by clicking the “Reply with AI” button. This approach was chosen because many customers prefer to review, edit, or approve AI-generated responses before sendi"}, {"id": "rcg_63933531_installationsetup", "severity": "high", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32085317", "is_critical": false, "feedback_type": "complaint", "is_suggestive": false, "mention_count": 9, "short_summary": "Hurdles with initial server setup, missing extension requirements, or broken installation script.", "competitor_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/whatscrm-whatsapp-crm-ai-automation-and-multichannel-saas-bundle-nodejs-script/63933531", "competitor_name": "WhatsCRM | WhatsApp CRM, AI Automation and Multi", "confidence_level": "High", "complaint_category": "Installation & Setup", "latest_occurrence_date": "3 days ago", "representative_comment": "I am interested in purchasing your product, but before proceeding, I’d like to confirm a few technical details regarding customization.\\n\\nOur dev team the description indicates that the frontend consists only of compiled code. Is it possible to provide the full source code so that our team can make modifications, rather than receiving only the compiled code. Could you please clarify:\\n\\nFull Unminified Source Code: Do you provide the complete, raw React frontend source code (components, JSX/TSX files, unbundled setup) and un-obfuscated Node.js backend code?\\n\\nBuild Scripts & Configuration: Are the build scripts (Webpack, Vite, Babel, etc.), package.json, and database migration/seed files included?\\n\\nCustomization Restrictions: Are there any compiled binaries, encrypted files, or licensing locks (like IonCube or hidden core modules) that would prevent our team from modifying the features, logic, or UI?\\n\\nand last one how to connect with the whatsapp support team?"}, {"id": "rcg_63933531_documentationguides", "severity": "medium", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32080923", "is_critical": false, "feedback_type": "complaint", "is_suggestive": false, "mention_count": 2, "short_summary": "Missing, outdated, or confusing setup manuals and API references.", "competitor_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/whatscrm-whatsapp-crm-ai-automation-and-multichannel-saas-bundle-nodejs-script/63933531", "competitor_name": "WhatsCRM | WhatsApp CRM, AI Automation and Multi", "confidence_level": "Medium", "complaint_category": "Documentation & Guides", "latest_occurrence_date": "3 days ago", "representative_comment": "Hello Author,\\n\\nPlease let me as under:\\n\\n1. Can a completely independent customer create/connect their own Meta Business Portfolio, WABA and WhatsApp Business phone number through Embedded Signup on my SaaS, while I operate as the platform/Tech Provider, with each customer’s assets remaining owned by that customer?\\n\\n2. Does the current version support production Embedded Signup without requiring each customer to manually configure their own Meta developer app?\\n\\nYour quick reply will be highly appreciated.\\n\\nWish you best of luck."}, {"id": "rcg_63933531_workflowcustomizationsuggestion", "severity": "low", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32085389", "is_critical": false, "feedback_type": "suggestion", "is_suggestive": true, "mention_count": 2, "short_summary": "Inquiry regarding custom business workflows, white-label branding, or localization support.", "competitor_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/whatscrm-whatsapp-crm-ai-automation-and-multichannel-saas-bundle-nodejs-script/63933531", "competitor_name": "WhatsCRM | WhatsApp CRM, AI Automation and Multi", "confidence_level": "Medium", "complaint_category": "Workflow & Customization Suggestion", "latest_occurrence_date": "4 days ago", "representative_comment": "First of all, congratulations on your work. I am interested in purchasing the platform, but I would like to clarify a few points regarding customization:\\n\\nIs it possible to edit the frontend?\\n\\nIs it possible to provide a version with the frontend code open for editing?\\n\\nIs there a specific plan for this type of purchase? Is it possible to buy the fully open source code from you?"}, {"id": "rcg_63933531_generalsuggestioninquiry", "severity": "low", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/32085320", "is_critical": false, "feedback_type": "suggestion", "is_suggestive": true, "mention_count": 13, "short_summary": "User submitted a constructive suggestion, pre-sales inquiry, or feature query.", "competitor_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/whatscrm-whatsapp-crm-ai-automation-and-multichannel-saas-bundle-nodejs-script/63933531", "competitor_name": "WhatsCRM | WhatsApp CRM, AI Automation and Multi", "confidence_level": "High", "complaint_category": "General Suggestion / Inquiry", "latest_occurrence_date": "4 days ago", "representative_comment": "Hello aman88work, Thank you for showing your interest. The answer will remain the same, as everything is already mentioned in the de