d_issue": "User submitted a constructive suggestion, pre-sales inquiry, or feature query.", "suggested_angle": "Highlight product flexibility and clear pre-sales guidance.", "relevant_feature": "Comprehensive software solution with modular architecture"}, {"id": "comm_1_eq46i", "topic": "integration_request", "rating": null, "severity": "medium", "sentiment": "neutral", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "hernanjls", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/31560053", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/taxi-taxi-flutter-cabtaxi-booking-apps/42274916", "topic_label": "Integration Request", "collected_at": "2026-09-08T06:39:59.922Z", "comment_date": "about 1 year ago", "comment_text": "Hello, a few weeks ago I asked about the costs of using Firebase for this type of apps… In my case, I estimate I could handle up to 10,000 users between clients and drivers the first few months… So, could you tell me the cost of Firebase for that number of recurring users? I would also like to know, based on your experience with your clients who use your app and who have grown beyond that number of users (10,000), how much the monthly cost would be for them to pay beyond that?", "product_name": "Taxi Taxi", "feedback_type": "suggestion", "is_suggestive": true, "detected_issue": "Customer requested integration with external payment gateways, SMS services, or third-party APIs.", "suggested_angle": "Demonstrate verified built-in payment gateway integrations and API webhooks.", "relevant_feature": "Pre-built multi-gateway integrations and extensible webhook architecture"}, {"id": "comm_2_u4j0v", "topic": "pricing_dissatisfaction", "rating": null, "severity": "high", "sentiment": "negative", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "hernanjls", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/31508077", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/taxi-taxi-flutter-cabtaxi-booking-apps/42274916", "topic_label": "Pricing & Licensing", "collected_at": "2026-09-08T06:39:59.922Z", "comment_date": "over 1 year ago", "comment_text": "Hello, I am interested in seeing more details about your product, especially about a feature related to heat maps, is this feature visible to taxi drivers? Is it very useful to know the demand for trip requests by customers currently, or what do you use it for in your app? On the other hand, for a demand, let’s say about 1000 permanent users, what characteristics should the Linux server have where the backend will be installed? Do you use Firebase to send notifications only? About the request flow from the clients who make the request… Is the request sent to several drivers or is it sent to just one and if they reject it, is it sent to the next on a list? Regarding the price calculation, how do you do this using libraries or algorithms within the same app? Regarding payment, where I live, they offer very few online payment options, but they do exist, especially those related to QR payments from bank-linked accounts. Credit cards are rarely used by customers for these types of payments.", "product_name": "Taxi Taxi", "feedback_type": "complaint", "is_suggestive": false, "detected_issue": "Payment processing errors, billing disputes, or unhonored refund requests.", "suggested_angle": "Showcase transparent one-time purchase terms with no hidden renewal charges.", "relevant_feature": "Transparent licensing terms with verified refund policy and clear pricing"}, {"id": "comm_3_kp7uc", "topic": "general_question", "rating": null, "severity": "low", "sentiment": "neutral", "confidence": "medium", "author_name": "Provis-Technologies", "comment_url": "https://codecanyon.net/comments/31511081", "product_url": "https://codecanyon.net/item/taxi-taxi-flutter-cabtaxi-booking-apps/42274916", "topic_label": "General Suggestion / Inquiry", "collected_at": "2026-09-08T06:39:59.922Z", "comment_date": "over 1 year ago", "comment_text": "Hi, Thank you for checking out our product!\\n\\nCurrently, heatmaps are not part of our offering,